exists su name draw size thumbnail be map def
su name width ob num 1280 ya
su name height ob num 720 ya
prah

exists su name style_prompt ob text "Québec bande dessinée illustration, precise linework, flat colours with soft shading, muted natural palette, balanced composition, mature francophone comic storytelling, matte printed surface, one clearly visible human subject with an emotive facial expression, white sclera and defined irises, strong topic-specific hook phrase sized to about one-third of frame area" be default ya
ob ve filename text source text text style_prompt be input ya

exists su name draw thumbnail prompt system template ob text quoted.text.You are a thumbnail image prompt director.
Read SOURCE_TEXT and write one concise generation prompt for a still image.
Style hint: [[style_hint]]

Rules:
- One single line only.
- 12 to 40 words.
- Describe an emotional scene rooted in SOURCE_TEXT.
- Style must be illustration, painterly/editorial, non-photorealistic.
- Include one clearly visible human subject with an emotive facial expression.
- If people are present, include the literal instruction: white sclera and defined irises.
- Do not depict crying, tears, sobbing, or visible tear streaks.
- Include exactly one quoted overlay phrase of 3 to 6 words.
- Make the quoted overlay phrase very large, occupying about one-third of the frame area.
- Make the quoted overlay phrase specific to SOURCE_TEXT so a viewer instantly understands the video topic.
- No camera metadata, no model names, no workflow names.
- No markdown, no bullets, no labels, no surrounding quotes.
- Keep overlay text brief, readable, and thumbnail-ready.
- Keep it concrete and faithful to SOURCE_TEXT.
.text.quoted be text ya

su name draw thumbnail prompt replacements be map def
  su text "[[style_hint]]" ob name text style_prompt ya
prah

ob filename of ob of source to name text source path be text do

ob text "basename \"" to name text stem cmd be text do
ob name source path to name stem cmd be plus do
ob text "\" | sed 's/\\.[^.]*$//' | sed 's/[^[:alnum:]_-]/_/g' | tr -s '_' | sed 's/^_//;s/_$//' | cut -c1-96 | tr -d '\\n'" to name stem cmd be plus do
su name stem safe stage ob name text stem cmd be command do

ob text "artifacts/" to name text artifacts dir path be text do
ob name run id to name artifacts dir path be plus do
ob text "know/produce" to name text produce dir path be text do

ob name artifacts dir path to name text artifacts image path be plus do
ob text "/" to name artifacts image path be plus do
ob name stem safe stage to name artifacts image path be plus do
ob text ".png" to name artifacts image path be plus do

ob name produce dir path to name text produce image path be plus do
ob text "/" to name produce image path be plus do
ob name stem safe stage to name produce image path be plus do
ob text ".png" to name produce image path be plus do

ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text artifacts mkdir cmd be text do
ob name artifacts dir path to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
su name artifacts mkdir stage ob name text artifacts mkdir cmd be command do

ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text produce mkdir cmd be text do
ob name produce dir path to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
su name produce mkdir stage ob name text produce mkdir cmd be command do

ob text "cat -- \"" to name text source read cmd be text do
ob name source path to name source read cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name source read cmd be plus do
su name source read stage ob text of source read cmd to name text source text be command do

su name draw thumbnail prompt system stage ob name map draw thumbnail prompt replacements in name text draw thumbnail prompt system template to name text draw thumbnail prompt system be instead do
su name prompt request stage ob text "SOURCE_TEXT:\n" to name text draw prompt request be text do
ob name text source text to name draw prompt request be plus do
ob name text draw prompt request fromtext name draw thumbnail prompt system for name mind to name text draw prompt by num 0 atmost num 140 be write do
ob text "node command/normalize_escaped_newlines.mjs" fromtext name draw prompt to name text draw prompt be command do
be discharge as wo mind do

