ob num of height of draw size thumbnail to name draw cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
ob text " --output \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
ob name artifacts image path to name draw cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
